    ("Removed unused files and directories") and the links broke with 30 x MSB3030 in any
    configuration whose output directory was not already populated - which is why only Release
    failed while a stale bin\Debug\net10.0 kept Debug green. They now live in this project,
    which is the only one that still uses them. The names are what the gallery pages look up at
    runtime (ImageSource.FromFile("crimson.jpg") and friends), so they must stay flat.
